    "**ADAM ID: **[sm\\_us6000ucij](https://api.adam.geospatial.wfp.org/api/collections/adam.adam_eq_events/items?uid=sm_us6000ucij) Magnitude 6.8 earthquake at 143.423 depth occurred on Nov 21 2026 26km SE of Hila. The epicentre of the earthquake was located at latitude -7.7563 longitude 127.5428. It impacted 2500 people within 50km. WFP’s Automated Disaster Analysis and Mapping (ADAM) system is an operational system for collecting, analysing and mapping geospatial and socio-economic information following sudden onset humanitarian emergencies."
